{"2359390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Just Climb", "steam_appid": 2359390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Help John save his coffee shop!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Rousty Town, nothing ever goes as planned. When John’s coffee shop loses power, his daily routine is turned upside down. Fortunately, there’s still a way out: set off on an adventure across the city to gather what’s <strong>needed and get the café back on its feet.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a colorful world filled with <strong>tricky platforms and unexpected challenges.</strong> Climb, jump, and progress through several unique environments, each with its own obstacles and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But be careful:</strong> in <i>Just Climb</i>, every jump matters. One mistake, bad timing, or poorly judged fall can <strong>quickly turn a perfect climb into a memorable disaster!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359390/extras/253f7de114fda41817dfbaa2955d4429.avif?t=1781804221\" width=615 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traverse several unique environments:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deserts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snowy peaks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caves </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Volcanic regions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A precision-based platformer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your movement and take on increasingly demanding challenges in a world that is as fun as it is unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level introduces new obstacles to overcome, tricky sections to master, and situations <strong>that are sometimes as frustrating as they are hilarious.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So… ready to embark on this little adventure where every fall is funnier than the last?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359390/extras/a80fd0774ebd9907fca70196eb6c39a5.avif?t=1781804221\" width=615 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D precision-based platformer focused on exploration</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple environments to explore</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable characters</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful low poly world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player adventure full of surprises</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you reach the top and help John save his coffee shop?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359390/extras/81315ced64c32a2c3eb029730867733d.avif?t=1781804221\" width=615 height=131 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Help John save his coffee shop!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Rousty Town, nothing ever goes as planned. When John’s coffee shop loses power, his daily routine is turned upside down. Fortunately, there’s still a way out: set off on an adventure across the city to gather what’s <strong>needed and get the café back on its feet.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a colorful world filled with <strong>tricky platforms and unexpected challenges.</strong> Climb, jump, and progress through several unique environments, each with its own obstacles and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But be careful:</strong> in <i>Just Climb</i>, every jump matters. One mistake, bad timing, or poorly judged fall can <strong>quickly turn a perfect climb into a memorable disaster!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359390/extras/253f7de114fda41817dfbaa2955d4429.avif?t=1781804221\" width=615 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traverse several unique environments:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deserts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snowy peaks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caves </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Volcanic regions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A precision-based platformer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your movement and take on increasingly demanding challenges in a world that is as fun as it is unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level introduces new obstacles to overcome, tricky sections to master, and situations <strong>that are sometimes as frustrating as they are hilarious.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So… ready to embark on this little adventure where every fall is funnier than the last?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359390/extras/a80fd0774ebd9907fca70196eb6c39a5.avif?t=1781804221\" width=615 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D precision-based platformer focused on exploration</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple environments to explore</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable characters</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful low poly world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player adventure full of surprises</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you reach the top and help John save his coffee shop?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359390/extras/81315ced64c32a2c3eb029730867733d.avif?t=1781804221\" width=615 height=131 /></span></p>", "short_description": "John needs your help. Climb to the top. Avoid the fall. Fail. Try again. A precision platformer that's as frustrating as it is fun.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359390/bf040b135a06be63cebdc66970d4cbb52dde1444/header.jpg?t=1781804221", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359390/bef62adf5b0dfc30742b9dcf49d16d3706d182f6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781804221", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359390/bef62adf5b0dfc30742b9dcf49d16d3706d182f6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t